        "Toraño Exodus Robusto (2016 version) — 5 × 54, 6.99 dollars. Connecticut Broadleaf binder with Mexican, Honduran and Dominican fillers; the fifth blend General Cigar issued after acquiring Toraño, discontinued in 2017",
        "Carlos Toraño Noventa — the 2006 line marking the family's ninety years in tobacco, with vitolas such as the Santiago bearing the founder's name"
